  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>level · 4×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 1024 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-core-reduction-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-core-reduction-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">enable subgroups;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">requires subgroup_id;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">const ELEMENT_COUNT: u32 = 1024u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const VALUES_PER_ROW: u32 = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"6\">const INPUT_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"8\">const OUTPUT_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const OUTPUT_VALIDITY_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; inputValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; outputValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"13\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; outputValidity: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; firstScratch: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; secondScratch: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; validityScratch: array&lt;u32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"18\">@compute @workgroup_size(256) fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">  @builtin(subgroup_invocation_id) subgroupInvocationId: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">  @builtin(subgroup_size) subgroupSize: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">  @builtin(subgroup_id) subgroupId: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  let workgroupIndex = (workgroupId.z * 1u + workgroupId.y) * 4u + workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 4u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  let lane = localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  var value = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  var secondValue = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  var valid = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  if (index &lt; ELEMENT_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">    value = inputValues[INPUT_OFFSET + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">    secondValue = value;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">    valid = select(0u, 1u, value == value &amp;&amp; abs(value) &lt;= 3.402823466e+38);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  let subgroupValid = subgroupMax(valid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  let subgroupFirst = subgroupMax(select(-3.402823466e+38, value, valid != 0u));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  let subgroupSecond = subgroupMax(select(-3.402823466e+38, secondValue, valid != 0u));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  if (subgroupInvocationId == 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">    firstScratch[subgroupId] = subgroupFirst;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">    secondScratch[subgroupId] = subgroupSecond;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">    validityScratch[subgroupId] = subgroupValid;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  let subgroupCount = 256u / subgroupSize;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  if (subgroupCount &gt; 1u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">    var stride = subgroupCount / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">    loop {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">      if (lane &lt; stride) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">        let rightValid = validityScratch[lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">      if (rightValid != 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">        if (validityScratch[lane] == 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">          firstScratch[lane] = firstScratch[lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">          secondScratch[lane] = secondScratch[lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">        } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">          firstScratch[lane] = max(firstScratch[lane], firstScratch[lane + stride]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">          secondScratch[lane] = max(secondScratch[lane], secondScratch[lane + stride]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">        validityScratch[lane] = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">      workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">      if (stride == 1u) { break; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">      stride = stride / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  if (lane == 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">    outputValues[OUTPUT_OFFSET + workgroupIndex * VALUES_PER_ROW] = firstScratch[0];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">    \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">    outputValidity[OUTPUT_VALIDITY_OFFSET + workgroupIndex] = validityScratch[0];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>inputValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"rainfall\">rainfall</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>outputValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"rainfall-max-level-0-values\">rainfall-max-level-0-values</td><td>write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>outputValidity<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"rainfall-max-level-0-validity\">rainfall-max-level-0-validity</td><td>write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUReduction/level/subgroups · main · c36d668b</figcaption></figure></section>",
